# Copy this file to .personal-terms (ignored by git) and fill it in.
# One word or phrase per line, case-insensitive.
# The pre-commit hook blocks any commit that contains one of them.
#
# What to list:
#   your full name
#   your personal emails and usernames
#   employer, university, course names
#   private project names, places, people close to you
#   schedules or activities that could identify you
